teless persons who have not been granted a residence permit are not taken into account in figures provided by the Belgian Government.","fn_3e3898f4":"Refugee figure relates to the end of 2016.","fn_46e9b8c9":"Refers to Palestinian refugees under the UNHCR mandate only.","fn_47bb62cf":"Refers to Palestinian refugees under the UNHCR mandate only.","fn_5f17920c":"Refers to Palestinian refugees under UNHCR's mandate only.","fn_6178591d":"Data refers to number of cases or mix of persons and cases.","fn_6650e90b":"Stateless persons reported by UNHCR correspond to recognized stateless persons who have been granted a residence permit in Belgium and who are therefore registered in the national register. It should be noted that recognized stateless persons who have not been granted a residence permit are not taken into account in figures provided by the Belgian Government.","fn_6d29fce0":"Refers to Palestinian refugees under the UNHCR mandate only.","fn_74bea089":"The data is based on the registered population as of end-2020, as data for 2021 was not available at time of publication apart from the data on asylum-seekers, which was sourced from Eurostat, and resettlement which was sourced from the Federal Agency for the Reception of Asylum Seekers.","fn_8e2d7783":"The data is based on the registered population as of end-2020, as data for 2021 was not available at time of publication apart from the data on asylum-seekers, which was sourced from Eurostat, and resettlement which was sourced from the Federal Agency for the Reception of Asylum Seekers.","fn_955fabe6":"Refers to Palestinian refugees under the UNHCR mandate only.","fn_a8095e29":"Refers to Palestinian refugees under the UNHCR mandate only.","fn_a971a679":"Stateless persons reported by UNHCR correspond to recognized stateless persons who have been granted a residence permit in Belgium and who are therefore registered in the national register. It should be noted that recognized stateless persons who have not been granted a residence permit are not taken into account in figures provided by the Belgian Government.","fn_b4886b91":"Refers to Palestinian refugees under the UNHCR mandate only.","fn_c333c408":"Data refers to number of cases or mix of persons and cases.","fn_caddd987":"Refers to Palestinian refugees under the UNHCR mandate only.","fn_de57f937":"Stateless persons reported by UNHCR correspond to recognized stateless persons who have been granted a residence permit in Belgium and who are therefore registered in the national register. It should be noted that recognized stateless persons who have not been granted a residence permit are not taken into account in figures provided by the Belgian Government.","fn_f1cab7bd":"Belgium includes a 'stateless' category in its National Registry, which records people who have been recognised as stateless and issued long-term residence permits in Belgium. There are also stateless people who are not counted in the National Registry data, for example, people awaiting determination of their statelessness, people recognised as stateless but not granted a residence permit, stateless people holding a short-term residence permit, and stateless people in the asylum procedure.","fn_f93a70b7":"Refugee figure related to the end of 2016.","fn_fc4b7ceb":"Refers to Palestinian refugees under the UNHCR mandate only."},"raw_files":{"conflict.csv":{"label":"IDMC GIDD, conflict and violence (HDX csv)","header":["iso3","country_name","year","new_displacement","new_displacement_rounded","total_displacement","total_displacement_rounded"]},"demographics/2025.zip":{"label":"UNHCR API download (demographics/2025.zip)","header":["Year","Country of origin","Country of origin (ISO)","Country of asylum","Country of asylum (ISO)","Population Type","Female 0 - 4","Female 5 - 11","Female 12 - 17","Female 18 - 59","Female 60","Female other","Female total","Male 0 - 4","Male 5 - 11","Male 12 - 17","Male 18 - 59","Male 60","Male other","Male total","Total"]},"persons_of_co